#: ../../project/docs/deploying/nginx.rst:2 c47160e4440b4ed3bb9f2c952dec5c16
msgid "nginx"
msgstr "nginx"

#: ../../project/docs/deploying/nginx.rst:4 b0dc224951b84e76a09a15f070e1c8b5
msgid ""
"`nginx`_ is a fast, production level HTTP server. When serving your "
"application with one of the WSGI servers listed in :doc:`index`, it is "
"often good or necessary to put a dedicated HTTP server in front of it. "
"This \"reverse proxy\" can handle incoming requests, TLS, and other "
"security and performance concerns better than the WSGI server."
msgstr ""
"`nginx`_ 是一个快速、可用于生产环境的 HTTP 服务器。当你使用 :doc:`index` "
"中列出的某个 WSGI 服务器来运行你的应用时，"
"通常建议或有必要在其前面放置一个专用的 HTTP 服务器。这个“反向代理”可以比 "
"WSGI 服务器更好地处理传入请求、TLS 以及其他安全和性能相关的问题。"

#: ../../project/docs/deploying/nginx.rst:10 c6676b7703714eeb86fb3d89f55ebc09
msgid ""
"Nginx can be installed using your system package manager, or a pre-built "
"executable for Windows. Installing and running Nginx itself is outside "
"the scope of this doc. This page outlines the basics of configuring Nginx"
" to proxy your application. Be sure to read its documentation to "
"understand what features are available."
msgstr ""
"可以使用系统的包管理器安装 Nginx，或者在 Windows 上使用预构建的可执行文件。"
"Nginx 本身的安装与运行不在本文档的范围内。本页面仅介绍配置 Nginx "
"来代理你的应用的基础步骤。请务必阅读它的官方文档以了解可用的功能。"

#: ../../project/docs/deploying/nginx.rst:20 1d3e23a326ba480488bf38f6db8698d4
msgid "Domain Name"
msgstr "域名"

#: ../../project/docs/deploying/nginx.rst:22 ae389f8416d64695afb0d08fe315b855
msgid ""
"Acquiring and configuring a domain name is outside the scope of this doc."
" In general, you will buy a domain name from a registrar, pay for server "
"space with a hosting provider, and then point your registrar at the "
"hosting provider's name servers."
msgstr "获取和配置域名不在本文档的范围内。通常，你需要从域名注册商购买一个域名，在主"
"机服务商处购买服务器资源，然后将你的域名指向该主机服务商的服务器。"

#: ../../project/docs/deploying/nginx.rst:27 2ddf4846535e4757bf4b5adfb5bb02ed
msgid ""
"To simulate this, you can also edit your ``hosts`` file, located at "
"``/etc/hosts`` on Linux. Add a line that associates a name with the local"
" IP."
msgstr ""
"为了模拟这种情况，你也可以编辑你的 ``hosts`` 文件，在 Linux 系统中该文件位于 "
"``/etc/hosts``。添加一行，将一个名称关联到本地 IP。"

#: ../../project/docs/deploying/nginx.rst:31 c84782d67aff4c5da0f3d2aaf8ff4447
msgid ""
"Modern Linux systems may be configured to treat any domain name that ends"
" with ``.localhost`` like this without adding it to the ``hosts`` file."
msgstr ""
"现代的 Linux 系统可能已经配置好自动将以 ``.localhost`` "
"结尾的域名当作本地地址，无需将其添加到 ``hosts`` 文件中。"

#: ../../project/docs/deploying/nginx.rst:35 ce22f4e4e5d6420ca1c00cd27445f644
msgid "``/etc/hosts``"
msgstr "``/etc/hosts``"

#: ../../project/docs/deploying/nginx.rst:42 78f767f9d6c5483f96ff33d1441a84e8
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

#: ../../project/docs/deploying/nginx.rst:44 9a9ab4c4e2604f7eb4f1e253de350c96
msgid ""
"The nginx configuration is located at ``/etc/nginx/nginx.conf`` on Linux."
" It may be different depending on your operating system. Check the docs "
"and look for ``nginx.conf``."
msgstr ""
"Nginx 的配置文件在 Linux 系统中位于 ``/etc/nginx/"
"nginx.conf``。在其他操作系统上可能有所不同，请查看相关文档并搜索 "
"``nginx.conf``。"

#: ../../project/docs/deploying/nginx.rst:48 98fee79dd617486ea4e2d9f27a43885f
msgid ""
"Remove or comment out any existing ``server`` section. Add a ``server`` "
"section and use the ``proxy_pass`` directive to point to the address the "
"WSGI server is listening on. We'll assume the WSGI server is listening "
"locally at ``http://127.0.0.1:8000``."
msgstr ""
"移除或注释掉现有的任何 ``server`` 段。添加一个 ``server`` 段，并使用 "
"``proxy_pass`` 指令指向 WSGI 服务器正在监听的地址。我们假设 WSGI "
"服务器在本地监听 ``http://127.0.0.1:8000``。"

#: ../../project/docs/deploying/nginx.rst:53 5505f696d5d941cbbb05419e30551136
msgid "``/etc/nginx.conf``"
msgstr "``/etc/nginx.conf``"

#: ../../project/docs/deploying/nginx.rst:69 fea04017ddc94d7e86b54cb3c535b86c
msgid "Then :doc:`proxy_fix` so that your application uses these headers."
msgstr "然后配置 :doc:`proxy_fix`，以便你的应用程序可以使用这些头部信息。"
